        <briefdescription>
<para>GOCART2G wet-removal entry point (scheme &apos;gocart&apos;). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Separate bind(C) entry from the Jacob bridge so the protected Jacob surface (run_wetdep_science_bridge) stays byte-identical. Shares this module&apos;s species-array marshalling idiom; differs in the scheme configuration record (WetDepSchemeGOCARTConfig) and the two additional surface precipitation inputs PRECCON/PRECLSC required by the GOCART kernel (instantaneous rain amounts [m], divided by tstep inside the kernel to rates [m/s]). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
